### Additional information

The device is a water level controller with two alert thresholds (upper/lower limit) and temperature monitoring. 
Key DPs in the Tuya cloud response:
- DP 102: Water level (value)
- DP 103: Lower level limit
- DP 104: Upper level limit
- DP 106: Water level alarm
- DP 110: Status enum (e.g., ALARM_WLL)

I am available to test a custom quirk in my setup anytime.

### Description

I have a regulable standing desk. It already has some controls, like child lock, but it would be nice to be able to set the precise height for the desk.

